h2. Detailed Requirements
h3. 1. Filter Chip Behavior

*Rule:* View All and Favorites are mutually exclusive with Domain and Gateway. Domain and Gateway can be selected together.

*Scenario 1: View All is selected (default)*
 * View All chip → Black background
 * Favorites, Domain, Gateway → Gray background
 * No filters applied

*Scenario 2: Favorites is selected*
 * Favorites chip → Black background
 * View All, Domain, Gateway → Gray background
 * Domain and Gateway selections are cleared

*Scenario 3: Gateway is selected*
 * Gateway chip → Black background, shows "Gateway: [Name]"
 * View All and Favorites → Gray background
 * Domain can still be selected (both can be black)

*Scenario 4: Domain is selected*
 * Domain chip → Black background, shows domain info
 * View All and Favorites → Gray background
 * Gateway can still be selected (both can be black)

*Scenario 5: Both Domain and Gateway are selected*
 * Domain chip → Black background
 * Gateway chip → Black background
 * View All and Favorites → Gray background
 * Both filters are applied together (AND logic)

